---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { PLOKR_APP } from '../lib/constants';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Plokr"
  description="Plokr is the layer that keeps engineering in sync — security scanning and dependency health for teams that ship."
  current="about"
>
  <header class="phero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Plokr</span>
      <h1>We build the layer that keeps engineering in sync.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Plokr started with a simple frustration: the risk hiding in a team's dependencies and systems lived in none of the tools it already used. We set out to put it in one calm, trustworthy view.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap-sm">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Engineering teams don't lack data — they're drowning in it. GitHub, Bitbucket and GitLab know what's deployed and what's vulnerable. Jira and Trello hold the work. But no one place answers the question every engineering leader actually asks: <strong>is anything about to break?</strong></p>
        <p>Plokr is that place. We connect to the tools you already use and turn what they find into a clear picture of risk. Vulnerable packages get ranked, and none of it requires you to change how your team works.</p>
        <h2>Our principles</h2>
        <p>We believe observability tools should be <strong>calm</strong>, <strong>honest about what they touch</strong>, and <strong>useful from the first connection</strong>. Those beliefs shape every decision we make — from our authorize-first architecture to the way we rank a single alert above a wall of them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="ftag">What we value</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px">How we think about the product.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid2">
        {[
          ['Signal over noise','Most tools bury the one thing you need under a hundred you don\'t. We design for the alert that actually changes your day.'],
          ['Earn trust','We hold ourselves to the standard our customers hold their own infra. Least privilege, authorize-first, nothing hidden.'],
          ['Built by people who shipped','We know what it is to ship under pressure. Plokr is the tool we wished we had.'],
          ['Calm by default','Software for engineering leaders shouldn\'t add anxiety. Plokr is quiet until something needs you.'],
        ].map(([title, desc]) => (
          <div class="feat-card">
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec ctaband" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="box">
        <h2>Come build with us — or just try it.</h2>
        <p>We're a small team obsessed with making engineering legible. Reach out, or spin up a workspace.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={PLOKR_APP} data-auth="signup" style="background:#fff;color:#0C1A2B">Start 7-day free trial</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line btn-lg" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
